> Most likely, `OpenAIAdapter.stream_response()` does not correctly handle the response/event format for `"gpt-5.5"`—or that model identifier is not supported by the particular endpoint/SDK path your adapter uses.
> 
> ## 4. Add temporary responder-level logging
> 
> Inside the initial stream loop, before `splitter.feed`:
> 
> ```python
> for raw_chunk in model.adapter.stream_response(...):
